OL,3,GNEWSADistraught residents 'helpless'
OL,4,Aover mill fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistraught residents say they have been
OL,7,Fleft feeling "helpless" after a former
OL,8,Fmill near their homes caught fire for a
OL,9,Fthird time this year.
OL,11,FThe huge blaze at Dalton Mills,
OL,12,FKeighley, started at about 20:00 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday and 12 fire engines were on
OL,14,Fthe scene at its peak.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fwas forced to evacuate a number of
OL,18,Fnearby properties due to smoke, embers
OL,19,Fand debris.
OL,21,FResident Teresa Taylor said: "We've had
OL,22,Fno sleep, we're all at our wits' end."
